«
@@ ============================================================
@@ AriesGHA — Greenwich hour angle of the first point of Aries, from the
@@ approximate Greenwich mean sidereal time of the US Naval Observatory.
@@ 
@@ Input : date time — date as YYYYMMDD, UT time as HH.MMSS.
@@ Output: the Greenwich hour angle of Aries.
@@ It is the mean value: it differs from the almanac by up to about 0.3′.
@@ ============================================================

  → dat tme
  «
    @ Dates as decimals: on a DM32, integer dates are rejected (issue #1873)
    dat DUP TypeName "unit" == « UVAL » « » IFTE EVAL →Num 20000101. DDays
    DUP TypeName "unit" == « UVAL » « » IFTE EVAL
    tme HMS→ 24 / + 0.5 - →Num
    → ddd
    «
      '(15*(18.697374558+24.06570982441908*ddd))' EVAL 360 MOD 1_° *
    »
  »
»
